{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_23","type":"command_execution","command":"/usr/bin/bash -lc 'pose artifact-check --help'","aggregated_output":"POSE - artifact-check\n\nReconcile declared spec artifacts with immutable Git changesets\n\nUsage:\n  pose artifact-check --spec <slug> [--from <rev> --to <rev>] [--strict|--tolerant] [--json]\n\nDescription:\n  Verifies that all files declared in section 3 (Technical Plan -> Artifacts) match the actual Git change set attributed to the spec trailer (POSE-Spec: <slug>).\n\nOptions / Flags:\n  --spec <slug>            Specification slug to reconcile\n  --from <rev>             Starting git revision for change set comparison\n  --to <rev>               Ending git revision for change set comparison\n  --strict                 Fail on any undeclared or missing artifact mismatch\n  --json                   Output reconciliation results in JSON format\n\nExamples:\n  $ pose artifact-check --spec user-auth --strict\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
