{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_80","type":"agent_message","text":"The remaining gaps are in how the gate is used: local predecessor milestones can satisfy dependency checks without a receipt; singleton milestones can close with an exit gate no review judged; and transferred members are counted by canonical identity but still checked as local children. Doctor also skips historical roadmaps before verifying whether their children’s reviews still stand.\n\nThe named artifact-check passed with provenance warnings. A separate check pinned to the brief’s full commit range failed on broader artifact mismatches; I’ll report that distinction explicitly.\n"}}
