{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_83","type":"command_execution","command":"/usr/bin/bash -lc \"go test ./internal/pose -run 'TestCloseoutReviewPolicyRound(Four|Five)' -v -count=1\"","aggregated_output":"=== RUN   TestCloseoutReviewPolicyRoundFour\n=== RUN   TestCloseoutReviewPolicyRoundFour/a_dispensed_multi-member_milestone_with_an_exit_gate_keeps_its_mode\n=== RUN   TestCloseoutReviewPolicyRoundFour/a_backward_link_to_a_missing_roadmap_is_unknown\n=== RUN   TestCloseoutReviewPolicyRoundFour/a_milestone_approved_before_adoption_stays_closed\n--- PASS: TestCloseoutReviewPolicyRoundFour (2.73s)\n    --- PASS: TestCloseoutReviewPolicyRoundFour/a_dispensed_multi-member_milestone_with_an_exit_gate_keeps_its_mode (0.00s)\n    --- PASS: TestCloseoutReviewPolicyRoundFour/a_backward_link_to_a_missing_roadmap_is_unknown (0.00s)\n    --- PASS: TestCloseoutReviewPolicyRoundFour/a_milestone_approved_before_adoption_stays_closed (2.72s)\n=== RUN   TestCloseoutReviewPolicyRoundFive\n=== RUN   TestCloseoutReviewPolicyRoundFive/a_milestone_approved_before_adoption_is_not_reached_again\n=== RUN   TestCloseoutReviewPolicyRoundFive/a_merely_reached_milestone_without_a_receipt_is_not_closed\n=== RUN   TestCloseoutReviewPolicyRoundFive/a_receipt_does_not_close_a_milestone_whose_consumed_outcome_is_unavailable\n=== RUN   TestCloseoutReviewPolicyRoundFive/the_last_open_member_carries_a_multi-member_exit_gate\n=== RUN   TestCloseoutReviewPolicyRoundFive/an_exempt_multi-member_milestone_with_an_unjudged_exit_gate_does_not_close\n=== RUN   TestCloseoutReviewPolicyRoundFive/an_unreadable_backward_link_target_is_unknown\n=== RUN   TestCloseoutReviewPolicyRoundFive/an_unreadable_backward_link_target_is_unknown/unreadable\n--- PASS: TestCloseoutReviewPolicyRoundFive (5.08s)\n    --- PASS: TestCloseoutReviewPolicyRoundFive/a_milestone_approved_before_adoption_is_not_reached_again (3.12s)\n    --- PASS: TestCloseoutReviewPolicyRoundFive/a_merely_reached_milestone_without_a_receipt_is_no